I only play vanilla so far but I like the idea of using lichen in this
way.  You only tend to notice lichen in the early game as a food
source and another 'use' for the none decaying bodies might be useful
as long as it was not overpowered.  Healing d4 HP sounds about right
to me. You would obviously have to weigh this up against it's use as a
food source.

Maybe another thing to think about: Bees honey is known to have
antiseptic properties (and not just in the hippie kind of aura crystal
world either), so maybe royal jelly could have a healing property
instead of just adding St.  Although I don't know what balance you'd
want between them.  Maybe instead of errr... is it d6 st?  You could
add d6 to maximum HP by (a)pplying it?


